# Theo Apples — Desired Site Look

Visual source of truth: Wix demo https://vasilevasilvena.wixsite.com/theo-apples  
Screenshots & studio assets: `docs/reference/` and `public/images/`  
Improve engineering and copy; do **not** restyle into SaaS/portfolio-template aesthetics.

## Palette

- Ivory canvas `#f2f2e9` / warm `#e6dfd2`
- Crimson `#b50022` (text, rules, CTAs)
- No UI shadows, rounded cards, or chrome gradients

## Typography

- Serif display: wordmark, hero, about, range titles, CONTACT
- Mono uppercase: nav, labels, craft caption, CTAs
- Small body for descriptions/forms

## Homepage order

Header → Hero collage → Craft statement → Split spread → About → Featured → Our Range → Limited Edition → Contact

## Domains (later)

Production `www.theoapples.com`; archives per `docs/SEO_DOMAIN_CUTOVER.md`. Wix = UI only.
